<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Landry's Seafood cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it downgraded Landry's Seafood Restaurants Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 7/8 to 20-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
